 - **Save Handler (`save_handler.py`):** An automated documentation updater that reads git diffs and uses an LLM to automatically maintain this exact set of 4 files (memory, progress, scratchpad, lessons). It is automatically placed at the root of any repository via a chpwd zsh hook when changing directories.
 - **Agent Skills:** Added `.agents/skills` directory containing reusable skills (e.g., systematic-debugging) to enhance the AI agent's ability to develop and maintain the project.
 
 ## Durable Rules & Constraints
 - **Global Availability:** `ask`, `chat`, `save`, and the council aliases (`/council`, `/MC`, `/mc`) are global zsh aliases so they can be run from any project directory.
-- **Token Limits (Free Models):** Prioritize free models (NVIDIA -> OpenRouter). Strict tracking of RPM (~40 limit) and RPD (50 limit) to avoid 429 Too Many Requests errors.
+- **Token Limits (Free Models):** NIM free: ~40 RPM globally. OpenRouter free: 20 RPM, 200 RPD (1000 with $10+ credits). Track usage to avoid 429 errors.
 - **Failsafe System:** `/safe` and `/restore` commands rely natively on local `git` snapshots to provide instant undo capabilities.
 - **Error Interception:** Proactive codebase scanning is disabled for performance. Error interception works reactively via `stderr` capture when a command fails.
+- **No 9router Dependency:** All routing goes directly to provider APIs. The `_9r()` function and port 20128 checks are being removed.
+- **Financial Domain Priority:** For Investogram, always prefer: DeepSeek V4 Flash (Python fixes), GLM-5.2 (multi-file agent), MiniMax M2.7 (financial modeling), Laguna S 2.1 (UI/frontend).
